            .msi x64 →
          </a>
          <a href={msiArmUrl}
             class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-mono bg-notion-green/10 hover:bg-notion-green/20 text-notion-teal hover:text-notion-teal border border-notion-green/20 hover:border-notion-green/40 transition">
            .msi Arm64 →
